{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_024590","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"没有军队，要怎么保卫国家？尤其是中美洲，到处都有冲突的火种吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"AUX_SPEAKER_NAME_REMOVED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"所以才需要外交。只要高举崇高理想，成为受其他国家尊敬的国家，就应该能得到国际社会的支持。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":132,"review_flag":"AUX_DIPLOMACY_LEADIN_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"实际上，尼加拉瓜入侵时，两次都是在<R=美洲国家组织,OAS>的斡旋下通过外交解决的。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=美洲国家组织,OAS>","cn_utf8_bytes":113,"review_flag":"AUX_TWO_INVASIONS_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"说到底，不还是依靠美国吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":"AUX_MISALIGNED_JPN_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"美国的影响力确实巨大。不过当时哥斯达黎加对美国的政策持批评态度。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":"JPN_COUNTRY_SUBJECT_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"即便如此，美国仍然支援哥斯达黎加，是因为哥斯达黎加奉行和平外交……也可以这么说吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":"JPN_QUALIFIER_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"确实，这也是一种博弈。但也有些国家会不顾一切地靠武力强压过来吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"也许吧……在Snake看来，我的想法可能太天真了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"但我们也没觉得什么都不做就能得到和平。外交也是一种战斗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"而且我觉得，必须不断找出灾祸的萌芽，并努力把它扼杀掉。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"所以，正因为这么想，我才去了他们的基地……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":"AUX_TRAPPED_ADDITION_REMOVED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"我不是在责怪你。你做得很出色。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":"AUX_PRAISE_MEANING_RESTORED"}]}